  "title": "wslua: Extended Lua get_preference(preference) with uat type preference.",
  "description": "This is a solution to issue #19394.\n\nUsage example:\n```lua\nlocal values = get_preference(\"protobuf.search_paths\")\nfor i, row in ipairs(values) do\n    local row_str = \"\"\n    for j, value in ipairs(row) do\n        row_str = row_str .. value .. \"\\t\"\n    end\n    print(row_str)\nend\n```",
